    rendered (incl. an empty queue count:0, web parity) + the disabled banner when !replay_enabled;
    empty = resolved-with-no-payload friendly state; error = +retry; stale/offline = freshness chip
    with cached cards kept visible.
  * i18n: all 10 source keys present verbatim (admin.dlq.stats.* / admin.dlq.banners.*); no English
    string literals in code (every label resolves through StatusHeaderStrings).
  * A11y: per-tile combined labels, banner + chip labels, decorative icons hidden, Dynamic Type
    (scalable fonts), reduce-motion respected (no custom animation), testable a11y summary seam.
  * Telemetry: model.start() emits `view.opened surface=StatusHeader` exactly once.

